From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ethan Hill <ethan.hill1999@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 13:52:08 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 20/20] CandyOS P38: SettingsLib switch widgets restyled to the
 4.4 Holo switch

Switch.SettingsLib, SwitchCompat.SettingsLib and
SwitchBar.Switch.Settingslib - the switchStyle for every Settings
surface (the main switch bar, panel dialogs, framework switch
widgets) - are parented to Widget.Holo.CompoundButton.Switch /
switch_track_holo_dark + switch_inner_holo_dark: the exact 4.4
donor drawables (switch_bg_holo_dark 9-patch track, state-list
thumb, ON/OFF track labels) instead of the M3 rounded pill
shapes. The modern 48dp min-height / fixed-height constraints are
dropped so the 9-patch renders at its intrinsic size; the row or
bar supplies the touch target (the widgets are clickable=false
anyway). settingslib_main_switch_bar (v31/v33) moves to
wrap_content height for the same reason.

The settingslib_switch_track/thumb shape drawables become unused;
the upstream files stay in place to limit drift.

Change-Id: If45ca56715a5b089dad4f911abc9ce097aa83df3
---
 .../layout-v31/settingslib_main_switch_bar.xml   |  4 +++-
 .../layout-v33/settingslib_main_switch_bar.xml   |  4 +++-
 .../MainSwitchPreference/res/values/styles.xml   | 12 ++++++------
 .../SettingsTheme/res/values-v31/styles.xml      | 16 ++++++++--------
 4 files changed, 20 insertions(+), 16 deletions(-)

diff --git a/packages/SettingsLib/MainSwitchPreference/res/layout-v31/settingslib_main_switch_bar.xml b/packages/SettingsLib/MainSwitchPreference/res/layout-v31/settingslib_main_switch_bar.xml
